        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth Nhial wee i̱, “Ɛn guäth ëëdan cua cɔ̱w kua̱ri Juda kɛnɛ ruëëc kɛ kɛ cɔ̱w bööthni palä kɛnɛ go̱o̱k kɛ cɔ̱w nɛɛni tëë cieŋ kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm ka̱m raar rɛy kɔ̱a̱knikiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua pa̱l nikɛ raar waaŋ ca̱ŋ kɛnɛ pay kɛ kuɛl kɛ nyin nhial diaal, tin nhɔk kɛn nikɛ kä lät kɛn nikɛ ikä, kä guur kɛn nikɛ, kä palkɛ nikɛ. Kä cu kɛn ruulidiɛn kɛnɛ kuɔ̱nydiɛn lo̱k, cua päl nikɛ ala di̱r jiäkni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛn duɔth nɛɛni diaal ti jiäk ti ŋot kɛ tëk ti, ba nhɔk ni lia̱a̱ kä ta̱a̱diɛn teekä, gua̱thni diaal tin cäkɛ riaw kä thi̱n, ruac ni ɣän Kuoth Nhial.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Duer kɛnɛ tɔ̱a̱ŋ",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jiath lɔaac Yir-mɛ-yaa kɛ kui̱ nɛɛnikɛ",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
